  "title": "CRA advises AWS on CMA’s cloud services market investigation",
  "summary": "On 5 October 2023, an investigation was initiated by the Competition and Markets Authority (CMA) into the supply of public cloud infrastructure services in the UK. The investigation follows a referral from Ofcom, which identified potential competition concerns within the cloud services market. A CRA team led by Mikaël Hervé, Sebastian Panthöfer, Christian Michel, Mariam Arutyunyan, […]",
